OL,3,GNEWSAUK's oldest living heart
OL,4,Atransplant recipient dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was one of the oldest living
OL,7,Fheart transplant recipients in the
OL,8,Fworld has died aged 95.
OL,10,FTed Warner was 59 when he received the
OL,11,Ftransplant from an anonymous donor at
OL,12,Fthe Papworth Hospital in Cambridgeshire
OL,13,Fin 1990, and was only expected to live
OL,14,Ffor eight more years.
OL,16,FBut Warner lived for more than three
OL,17,Fdecades before his death following a
OL,18,Fshort illness on 7 November. Prior to
OL,19,Fhis death, NHS officials confirmed he
OL,20,Fwas the UK's oldest living heart
OL,21,Ftransplant recipient.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
