OL,3,GNEWSAUK's oldest living heart
OL,4,Atransplant recipient dies
OL,5,
OL,6,FHis sons Neil and Adam told the BBC
OL,7,FWarner, from Broughton Astley in
OL,8,FLeicestershire, was a passionate
OL,9,Fadvocate for organ donation. Neil
OL,10,Fadded: "My dad always recognised that
OL,11,Fbehind our joy was another family's
OL,12,Ftragedy."
